    "body": "In this episode of Denatured, you’ll hear from Daniel Tillett, CEO of Racura Oncology and Sten Sörensen, CEO of Cereno Scientific. We explore why the FDA is now prioritizing drug repurposing, and what it will take to turn existing molecules into viable new therapies.\n> Listen on Spotify > Listen on Apple Podcasts > Listen on Amazon Music > Listen on iHeart > Watch on YouTube\nIn this episode of Denatured, you’ll listen to Daniel Tillett, CEO of Racura Oncology and Sten Sörensen, CEO of Cereno Scientific. We examine why the FDA is placing renewed emphasis on drug repurposing and what it will take to transform existing molecules into effective new therapies.\nHost\n⁠ Jennifer C. Smith-Parker , Director of Insights, BioSpace\nGuests\nDaniel Tillett , CEO, Racura Oncology\nSten Sörensen , CEO, Cereno Scientific\nDisclaimer: The views expressed in this discussion by guests are their own and do not represent those of their organizations.",
